                      (    forth6809.asm):01805         ; H_ABORT and H_QUIT are hand-built, not produced by the same
                      (    forth6809.asm):01806         ; generation pass as the 217 entries above - ABORT and QUIT need
                      (    forth6809.asm):01807         ; to be findable at the prompt, but HEADER/CREATE couldn't be used
                      (    forth6809.asm):01808         ; directly for these two (see the source conversation this file
                      (    forth6809.asm):01809         ; was derived from for why). Moved here from their own separate
                      (    forth6809.asm):01810         ; section so every header in this ROM lives in one contiguous
                      (    forth6809.asm):01811         ; block, with the chain visible end to end: H_M2 -> H_2 -> H_M1 ->
                      (    forth6809.asm):01812         ; H_1 -> H_FIND -> H_QUIT -> H_ABORT -> H_FALSE (the newest of the
                      (    forth6809.asm):01813         ; 217 generated entries) -> ... -> H_KEY -> 0. H_M2 is now the true
                      (    forth6809.asm):01814         ; head (see BASELATEST below) - H_FIND and the four number words
                      (    forth6809.asm):01815         ; were chained on after H_QUIT in a later turn.
