E617 3606             (    forth6809.asm):03168                   PSHU  D
E619 CCFFFF           (    forth6809.asm):03169                   LDD   #-1
E61C 3606             (    forth6809.asm):03170                   PSHU  D
E61E 39               (    forth6809.asm):03171                   RTS
