E905 39               (    forth6809.asm):03601                  RTS              ; on the limit (what's really at 4,S unshifted)
                      (    forth6809.asm):03602                                   ; instead of the index. The pair served no
                      (    forth6809.asm):03603                                   ; purpose (nothing needed offset 0 for anything
