F929                  (    forth6809.asm):06021         SUBSTITUTEW: ; REWRITE: was a plain substring search-and-replace on
                      (    forth6809.asm):06022                      ; the bare registered name (via SEARCHW), which found
                      (    forth6809.asm):06023                      ; "girl" and replaced only that span, leaving surrounding
                      (    forth6809.asm):06024                      ; "%...%" delimiters untouched in the output - and never
                      (    forth6809.asm):06025                      ; returned the substitution count ANS requires as a
                      (    forth6809.asm):06026                      ; third stack item. Per the ANS spec (forth-standard.org/
                      (    forth6809.asm):06027                      ; standard/string/SUBSTITUTE), SUBSTITUTE must scan for
                      (    forth6809.asm):06028                      ; text between '%' (ASCII $25) delimiter pairs
                      (    forth6809.asm):06029                      ; specifically: "%%" collapses to a single '%' (count
