                      (    forth6809.asm):06785                                      ; Answers PADMINSIZE (84) directly, per
                      (    forth6809.asm):06786                                      ; ANS's own /PAD meaning (3.3.3.6, "the
                      (    forth6809.asm):06787                                      ; size of the scratch area whose address
                      (    forth6809.asm):06788                                      ; is returned by PAD") - PAD's own region,
                      (    forth6809.asm):06789                                      ; growing upward from PAD itself, distinct
                      (    forth6809.asm):06790                                      ; from HOLDMINSIZE above (which answers
                      (    forth6809.asm):06791                                      ; for a different region entirely, the
                      (    forth6809.asm):06792                                      ; downward-growing pictured-numeric buffer
                      (    forth6809.asm):06793                                      ; in the CODEHERE-to-PAD gap). PADOFFSET
